1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:05,480
There are five key metrics that determine whether a routine system will actually work for a busy woman like you.
有五个关键指标，可以用来判断一套日常安排是否真的适合像你这样忙碌的人。

2
00:00:05,480 --> 00:00:07,240
Number one is time investment.
第一项是时间投入。

3
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:09,160
How much time the routine takes daily.
也就是这套安排每天需要多少时间。

4
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:10,840
Number two is startup overwhelm.
第二项是开始时的负担感。

5
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:13,400
How much of your life you have to adjust for the routine.
也就是为了这套安排，你得调整生活中的多少部分。

6
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:18,600
Number three is sustainability, which is basically how long you can realistically maintain this routine.
第三项是可持续性，简单说就是你实际上能把这个安排维持多久。

7
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:22,919
Number four is flexibility, which is what happens to this method when life gets messy.
第四项是灵活性，也就是生活一乱，这个方法还能怎样运作。

8
00:00:22,919 --> 00:00:25,549
And number five is realistic expectations.
第五项是切合实际的预期。

9
00:00:25,559 --> 00:00:28,279
Whether this routine actually fits into your lifestyle.
也就是这个安排究竟能不能融入你的生活方式。
